{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1214147-implementing-the-god-machine-in-your-home-games","id":1214147,"title":"Implementing The God Machine in your home games","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-05-02T07:19:59-07:00","id":1214147,"title":"Implementing The God Machine in your home games","content":"I was just wondering if you have implemented any of The God Machine lore into your home game/s? I haven't played in a while, but I like the idea of clockwork horrors hiding right behind reality. And I can't wait to run another Hunter game which has some eldritch space computer manipulating people into becoming Slashers and the like. So, what are some of the ways you have used TGM in your home game/s?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Co-Host of <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com/podcast\" target=\"_blank\">The Deliberative Podcast</a><br /> Follow us on <a href=\"http://www.twitter.com/deliberativepod\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter</a>!<br /> Follow us on <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/thedeliberativepodcast\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook</a>!<br /> Follow us on the <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com\" target=\"_blank\">Web</a>!<br /> Like what we do? Support us on <a href=\"http://patreon.com/thedeliberative\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4164-lukkychukky","name":"Lukkychukky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4164_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-02T07:30:28-07:00","id":1214149,"title":"","content":"In my Requiem game currently (started 1205 Venice) the players have a chest with the image of an angelic figure with lightning for wings engraved on it. So far it cannot be opened or destroyed.<br /> I planned for it to just be an interesting side thing, but the players have really focused on trying to open it so i'm rolling with it and made the chest more important to the game.<br /> They will have to summon an angel (God-Machine kind) to open the chest and it will not end well for anyone <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Completed campaign: Scion 2nd Edition. Les L\u00e9gendes Currently playing: Being a dad for a 3 year old daughter and a 2 years old son and now a beautiful new baby.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11312-maitrecorbo","name":"Maitrecorbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11312_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"719"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-02T10:31:09-07:00","id":1214210,"title":"","content":"In a previous Mage game the primary antagonists found and subverted a piece of infrastructure for their own dastardly plans. It was attached to the BART system and intended to slowly gather energy from the people of San Francisco, my antagonists had figured out a way to use it to devour one of the Bound, inadvertently killing everyone in the city but that was a price they were willing to pay.<br /> \u200bMy players, showing their true Mage spirit, killed the orcs, took the treasure and never gave one thought to who built the eldritch castle and why.<br /> That part was disappointing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6084-2pttakrill","name":"2ptTakrill","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"942"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-02T11:12:15-07:00","id":1214225,"title":"","content":"You could easily have infrastructure that brainwashes a target demographic into Slasher-hood for the purposes of elimination.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T04:29:20-07:00","id":1214526,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Malus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1214147-implementing-the-god-machine-in-your-home-games?p=1214225#post1214225\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You could easily have infrastructure that brainwashes a target demographic into Slasher-hood for the purposes of elimination.</div> </div> </div> </div>I really like this idea. I've read the short fiction anthology a few times, and it has such good flavor, but it always leaves me wondering how I could possibly implement it - in a compelling way - in my own game/s. It seems like some of the steampunk/clockwork aspects of it could potentially detract from a horror game as opposed to adding to the horror.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Co-Host of <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com/podcast\" target=\"_blank\">The Deliberative Podcast</a><br /> Follow us on <a href=\"http://www.twitter.com/deliberativepod\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter</a>!<br /> Follow us on <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/thedeliberativepodcast\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook</a>!<br /> Follow us on the <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com\" target=\"_blank\">Web</a>!<br /> Like what we do? Support us on <a href=\"http://patreon.com/thedeliberative\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4164-lukkychukky","name":"Lukkychukky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4164_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T04:52:29-07:00","id":1214534,"title":"","content":"In the setting I'm running, the GM once was building the city to it's ideal of perfection. And then the Seers and Pentacle had a little incident, which included the explosion of what was, effectively, a magical nuke that tore open abyssal holes all over the city. It destroyed magical energy (in terms of pretty much all fuel stats) throughout the city and it's surrounding areas, as well as creating a massive amount of general death, destruction and mayhem, which of course, effected the spirit world with an abundance of growth and change.<br /> <br /> In our game, the GM cannot percieve the Abyss, and is actively working against incursions of Arcadia as they are antithetical to it and it's purpose. It no longer has many angels in the city, but is working on trying to find a shard in which the Event did not happen. Of course, it's not the only high level creature with an interest in the city- currently it's trying to generate infrastructure that will close off other realms, using cults because it can't trust it's angels not to get a sight of the abyss and Fall. It has successfully generated one piece of infrastructure over a nearby lake that closed a hedge gate, but a trio of beasts burst the gate back open and unintentionally destroyed that piece of infrastructure. All three of those beasts have since vanished. With this new data gathered by it's cultists and a low level angel, it is preparing to attempt another piece- only this time, it has more pieces of the puzzle it can block- the primordial dream.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8122-archonares","name":"ArchonAres","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T05:47:25-07:00","id":1214552,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8122-archonares\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"8122\" data-vbnamecard=\"8122\">ArchonAres</a>, is this a Mage game you're running?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Co-Host of <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com/podcast\" target=\"_blank\">The Deliberative Podcast</a><br /> Follow us on <a href=\"http://www.twitter.com/deliberativepod\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter</a>!<br /> Follow us on <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/thedeliberativepodcast\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook</a>!<br /> Follow us on the <a href=\"http://www.fivepoles.com\" target=\"_blank\">Web</a>!<br /> Like what we do? Support us on <a href=\"http://patreon.com/thedeliberative\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4164-lukkychukky","name":"Lukkychukky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4164_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-03T06:27:45-07:00","id":1214566,"title":"","content":"Crossover. We have venues for mage, beast, and vampire active, with the occasional demon thrown in. We're looking to do some changeling when it finally comes out as well, and are quite interested in geist coming out. Werewolf is primarily npcs currently, as is changeling","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8122-archonares","name":"ArchonAres","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"316"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}